OL,3,GNEWSATeen barber giving back with free
OL,4,Ahaircuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young barber is combining a new
OL,7,Fcareer with fundraising and free
OL,8,Fhaircuts for people in need in
OL,9,FCleethorpes.
OL,11,FConnor Lancaster went into the
OL,12,Fprofession after teaching himself with
OL,13,Fa pair of clippers.
OL,15,FThe 16-year-old is now training at a
OL,16,Fbarber shop in the North East
OL,17,FLincolnshire town.
OL,19,FHe has started his own venture called
OL,20,FConnor's Cuts, saying everyone deserves
OL,21,Fa good haircut no matter their
OL,22,Fsituation.
